{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2026-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1772928000, "end_date": 1773619199, "month_true_total": 126, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:56:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "220774330", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803799058", "personaname": "Nuckka", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nuckka/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 12825, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9296, "last_played": 1788728749, "avatar": "07a68ecb33b17ff1ff10160fa1fabd5ba0551a7e"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very fun game.\r\nA competent shooter, the game has plenty of fun builds and weapons. The roguelike structure of the game really helps lend itself for replayability, I never expected to put as much time as I have into this game. The game is certainly based around co-op but the singleplayer gameplay is still quite fun, and I've come to play the game solo quite often even as I enjoy multiplayer play. The game has free seasonal updates that freshen the game up some as well.\r\nThere is a lot to say against the game, like the enemy and stage variety being pretty limited, most of the characters being behind DLC (the DLC kinda complete the game, not that worth playing without them imo), some characters and weapons being not so great. A big sticking point you wouldn't readily expect is that the translation for some of the free update stuff is pretty shockingly subpar at times, though the most recent season has been much improved on this front.\r\nThat said, the game is still very fun even with these issues. If you're looking for a good co-op roguelike shooter, I think this is one of the better if not best options out there.", "timestamp_created": 1773606543, "timestamp_updated": 1773606543, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.537366509437561035", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220771539", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993417647", "personaname": "MesuSan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993417647/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 1435, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1275, "deck_playtime_at_review": 229, "last_played": 1779153381, "avatar": "368f5eab73de2e6def2f6a769b9942fa619cf32d"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best FPS roguelikes on the market. Very respectful of my time and money. Great steamdeck experience.", "timestamp_created": 1773604378, "timestamp_updated": 1773604378, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220765814", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038534977", "personaname": "Mr.Hongkong", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038534977/", "num_games_owned": 196, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 176, "last_played": 1749324858, "avatar": "79c1ec8297bc0d8509dcd0cd86d05dad46658c34"}, "language": "english", "review": "-", "timestamp_created": 1773600037, "timestamp_updated": 1773600037, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.382335901260375977", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": 